table for Roger Marshall.","when":"2026-10-06","lean":"nonpartisan"}],"donorSignal":null,"research":{"summary":"Republican Senate President Ty Masterson and Democratic state Sen. Cindy Holscher are vying to succeed term limited Democratic Gov. Laura Kelly, and Kansas News Service reports Masterson leading in recent public polls while Holscher calls the race neck and neck. KCUR reports both are courting unaffiliated voters and each calls the other extreme, with property taxes and school funding at the center.","issues":[{"issue":"Property taxes","why":"Masterson backs a constitutional cap of 3 percent on yearly assessed value growth while Holscher backs cutting the residential assessment rate instead.","src":"https://lawrencekstimes.com/2026/10/13/kns-race-gov-taxes-ed-funding/"},{"issue":"School funding","why":"Holscher pledges to fully fund special education while Masterson stresses literacy, a spending review and private school tax credits.","src":"https://lawrencekstimes.com/2026/10/13/kns-race-gov-taxes-ed-funding/"},{"issue":"Cost of living and tariffs","why":"Holscher blames tariffs and higher diesel prices for squeezing farmers and families.","src":"https://www.kmuw.org/politics/2026-10-21/trump-affirms-endorsement-of-ty-masterson-in-kansas-governors-race-belittles-cindy-holscher"},{"issue":"Brownback tax legacy","why":"Holscher ties Masterson to the 2012 income tax cuts that lawmakers largely repealed in 2017.","src":"https://kansasreflector.com/2026/10/05/democrat-cindy-holschers-campaign-for-kansas-governor-highlights-distinctions-from-gop-rival/"},{"issue":"Abortion and Medicaid","why":"Holscher supports abortion rights and Medicaid expansion and warns Masterson would revive efforts like the 2022 amendment.","src":"https://kansasreflector.com/2026/10/05/democrat-cindy-holschers-campaign-for-kansas-governor-highlights-distinctions-from-gop-rival/"}],"storylines":[{"title":"Former KCK mayor backs Masterson","date":"2026-10-23","what":"Tyrone Garner, a Democrat and former Kansas City, Kansas mayor, endorsed Masterson, citing his economic and property tax plans.","helps":"R","kind":"endorsement","src":"https://hoodline.com/2026/10/ex-kck-mayor-tyrone-garner-a-democrat-backs-gop-s-ty-masterson-for-governor"},{"title":"Trump rallies for Masterson near Wichita","date":"2026-10-19","what":"At a Park City rally Trump reaffirmed his endorsement of Masterson and called Holscher the most radical candidate ever to run for governor. Holscher answered that she is fighting for everyday Kansans.","helps":"R","kind":"rally","src":"https://www.kmuw.org/politics/2026-10-21/trump-affirms-endorsement-of-ty-masterson-in-kansas-governors-race-belittles-cindy-holscher"},{"title":"Dueling property tax plans","date":"2026-10-13","what":"Masterson pitches a homeowners bill of rights capping value growth, while Holscher proposes a lower residential assessment rate. Critics say each plan shifts burden to other property owners.","helps":"mixed","kind":"policy","src":"https://lawrencekstimes.com/2026/10/13/kns-race-gov-taxes-ed-funding/"},{"title":"RGA linked group says Holscher would make Kansas California","date":"2026-10-13","what":"A super PAC linked to the Republican Governors Association ran an ad claiming Holscher wants to turn Kansas into California, while a Democratic billboard in Wichita ties Masterson to Sam Brownback.","helps":"mixed","kind":"ad","src":"https://lawrencekstimes.com/2026/10/13/kns-race-gov-taxes-ed-funding/"},{"title":"Farm Bureau and Teamsters split","date":"2026-10-12","what":"The Kansas Farm Bureau PAC endorsed Masterson while the Teamsters regional conference backed Holscher, adding to her list of union endorsements.","helps":"mixed","kind":"endorsement","src":"https://kansasreflector.com/2026/10/12/cindy-holscher-ty-masterson-gain-gubernatorial-endorsements-from-labor-ag-interests/"},{"title":"Holscher says Masterson is hiding from debates","date":"2026-10-05","what":"After a September joint appearance at the State Fair, Masterson called off two televised debates. Holscher says she would welcome another debate.","helps":"D","kind":"debate","src":"https://kansasreflector.com/2026/10/05/democrat-cindy-holschers-campaign-for-kansas-governor-highlights-distinctions-from-gop-rival/"},{"title":"Masterson labels Holscher a socialist","date":"2026-10-05","what":"Masterson has called Holscher a socialist. She rejects the label and points to her wins in competitive Johnson County districts.","helps":"R","kind":"attack","src":"https://kansasreflector.com/2026/10/05/democrat-cindy-holschers-campaign-for-kansas-governor-highlights-distinctions-from-gop-rival/"}],"events":[{"title":"Property tax relief plan","prompt":"Homeowners are angry about rising valuations and both parties back a constitutional amendment. You must say which approach you would push in your first session.","issue":"econ","src":"https://lawrencekstimes.com/2026/10/13/kns-race-gov-taxes-ed-funding/","opts":[{"label":"Fund special ed fully","say":"Ease local levies by having the state fully fund special education as the law requires.","pos":-0.7,"trump":null,"tone":"calm"},{"label":"Lower residential rate","say":"Cut the residential assessment rate without a hard cap on value growth.","pos":-0.2,"trump":null,"tone":"calm"},{"label":"Hard 3 percent cap","say":"Cap yearly assessed value growth at 3 percent in the constitution as a homeowners bill of rights.","pos":0.7,"trump":null,"tone":"fiery"}]},{"title":"Trump comes to Wichita","prompt":"President Trump holds a rally near Wichita and calls one candidate a radical lunatic. Unaffiliated voters outnumber Democrats in Kansas, and the campaign must decide how to respond.","issue":"other","src":"https://www.kmuw.org/politics/2026-10-21/trump-affirms-endorsement-of-ty-masterson-in-kansas-governors-race-belittles-cindy-holscher","opts":[{"label":"Hit tariffs and costs","say":"Answer that tariffs and diesel prices are hurting Kansas farmers and families.","pos":-0.6,"trump":-0.8,